   "kind": "flashcard",
   "shape": "hand-authored",
   "label": "f02-retry-model",
   "front": "How does a failed step get retried in FlowForge?",
   "back": "In the worker catch: attempts = job.attempts + 1. If attempts < maxAttempts (maxRetries + 1), markStepRetrying resets the same job row to AVAILABLE with readyAt = now + attempts * 15 s and the step to RETRYING, in one transaction. Otherwise the step is marked failed and the job dead.",
   "observation": "read-derived",
   "aiTag": false
  },
