   "kind": "flashcard",
   "shape": "hand-authored",
   "label": "f03-lease-gap",
   "front": "Why can a run stay RUNNING forever, and what is the fix?",
   "back": "The lease query only takes AVAILABLE rows, so a job leased by a worker that died stays LEASED. Fix: also select LEASED rows whose leasedUntil < NOW(), and check leaseToken when completing so a slow worker cannot finish a job re-leased to someone else.",
   "observation": "read-derived",
   "aiTag": false
  },
